      "message": "Addressed in patch set 10: added test_waits_across_polls_for_bootmode, which runs with the default bootmode_apply_timeout and get_bios_attribute returning mismatch then match, asserting True with 3 reads (initial read plus two polls). That exercises the sleep and the re-read after a mismatch, so a re-poll regression now fails. The fixture already sets bootmode_poll_interval to 0, so it costs no runtime.",
